    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Time concealment Immortal Gu is one of five time path Immortal Gu, counting those from Lang Ya Sect’s treasury and those exchanged from the variant humans, that Lang Ya land spirit gives Fang Yuan. It is one of the two rank seven among them, alongside time needle Immortal Gu. It can conceal the Gu Immortal, and Fang Yuan finds it the most helpful of the five and is extremely happy to have obtained it.",
